1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,667
Your software updated overnight.

2
00:00:02,767 --> 00:00:04,200
Your training didn't.

3
00:00:04,767 --> 00:00:10,580
Now someone has to re-shoot every screenshot, rewrite every step, and translate it all again.

4
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:13,232
Until they do, your people are guessing.

5
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:15,680
Introducing Steplight.

6
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:20,158
Do the process once, in your browser, and Steplight writes the guide for you.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,079
Every click becomes a clear, written step, with the screenshot already captured, and highlighted.

8
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:32,576
From that one recording, you get Word, PDF and PowerPoint guides, video walkthroughs,

9
00:00:32,626 --> 00:00:37,576
hands-on practice, scored tests, and SCORM packages for your LMS.

10
00:00:38,433 --> 00:00:43,692
Inside the app itself, Guide me walks people through it, live, one step at a time.

11
00:00:44,533 --> 00:00:47,090
When the software changes, press Replay.

12
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:52,455
Steplight re-runs the process, finds what moved, and refreshes every screenshot.

13
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,976
Every guide also comes in seven languages, without recording again.

14
00:00:59,033 --> 00:01:00,074
Steplight.

15
00:01:00,174 --> 00:01:02,404
Record it once, and it stays right.
